# Examples only: substitute compartment, dynamic group and this VM's OCID.
# Dynamic group dg-homologa-backup matching rule (one VM only):
# instance.id = 'ocid1.instance.REPLACE_WITH_INSTANCE_OCID'

Allow dynamic-group dg-homologa-backup to manage objects in compartment app-prod where all {target.bucket.name='bk-homologa-prod', any {request.permission='OBJECT_CREATE', request.permission='OBJECT_READ', request.permission='OBJECT_INSPECT'}}

# The VM cannot overwrite/delete objects. Keep the bucket private, Standard,
# versioning disabled, and configure a 7-day lifecycle through a separate admin.
# Object Storage's lifecycle service policy is separate from the VM policy.
# Use a read-only identity from outside OCI to collect independent encrypted copies.
